{"id":"498d8afd65d4a6ee","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-primes-and-composites-languages.md","title":"素数、合数及其二进制语言","display":"df-primes-and-composites-languages — 素数、合数及其二进制语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages","aliases":["73-df-primes-and-composites-languages"],"display":"df-primes-and-composites-languages — 素数、合数及其二进制语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.1 and §11.5.5, print pp. 512–514, 518–521; PDF pp. 534–536, 540–543; explicit coding-domain boundary","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-primes-and-composites-languages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primes-and-composites-languages — 素数、合数及其二进制语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.1 and §11.5.5, print pp. 512–514, 518–521; PDF pp. 534–536, 540–543; explicit coding-domain boundary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；整除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\mid n\">\\(d\\mid n\\)</span> 具有通常整数算术含义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NatWords},\\operatorname{Bin}\">\\(\\mathsf{NatWords},\\operatorname{Bin}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow n\\ge2\\land\\forall d\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;d\\nmid n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Composite}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow n\\ge2\\land\\exists d\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;d\\mid n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow n\\ge2\\land\\forall d\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;d\\nmid n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Composite}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow n\\ge2\\land\\exists d\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;d\\mid n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRIME}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Composite}(n)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus\\mathsf{PRIME}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PRIME}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Composite}(n)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus\\mathsf{PRIME}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NONPRIME}=\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(0),\\operatorname{Bin}(1)\\}\\cup(\\mathbf2^*\\setminus\\mathsf{NatWords}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NONPRIME}=\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(0),\\operatorname{Bin}(1)\\}\\cup(\\mathbf2^*\\setminus\\mathsf{NatWords}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>0、1 不算合数；非法或含前导零的编码也不属于规范合数语言。因此 COMPOSITE 不能直接冒充 PRIME 在所有二进制词中的补集。额外几类输入可在确定多项式时间处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；整除 $d\\mid n$ 具有通常整数算术含义。$\\mathsf{NatWords},\\operatorname{Bin}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d\\mid n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NatWords},\\operatorname{Bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow n\\ge2\\land\\forall d\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;d\\nmid n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Composite}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow n\\ge2\\land\\exists d\\in\\{2,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;d\\mid n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRIME}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Composite}(n)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{NONPRIME}\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus\\mathsf{PRIME}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NONPRIME}=\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Bin}(0),\\operatorname{Bin}(1)\\}\\cup(\\mathbf2^*\\setminus\\mathsf{NatWords}).","display":true}],"bytes":1854,"backlinks":[{"id":"b39bd6838766ad96","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages|素数、合数及其二进制语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"8527287e791b6212","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cc073a18f449598a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ff00e4aa0ef74db8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f7b3c70dde0fbf32","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["bc88ca69b33d5036"]}